      "comment": "CANGRANDE (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Apollo's Sun (24.14) in a Grade 4. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Rates highly and will give a great sight. ROCKY RACCOON (2) led throughout to score two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 8 length 5th at this track (24.23). Expected to feature in the finish. TIJUANA TWINKLE (7) copped a check in the run last time and never threatened when fourth (24.02) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Can do much better this time. FARMOR SENIOR (4) looks an each-way chance.",
